      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Kawalerka* is a studio flat, one room with a kitchen corner. A flat is *jednopokojowe* or *dwupokojowe*, by its rooms; *w bloku* (a block of flats) or *w kamienicy* (an old town house of flats); and an advert gives its size in *metry kwadratowe*: *trzydzieści metrów kwadratowych*, 30 m². *Po remoncie* is newly done up; *ogrzewanie* is the heating. A family lives in *dom jednorodzinny*."
      }
    }
